=============================================================
C-BEAM GANTRY PLATE  Rev C  125 x 125 x 6 mm  6061-T6 Al
Base plate: Bulkman3D PL0015 (C-Beam Gantry Plate XL)
URL: https://bulkman3d.com/product/pl0015/
Origin = bottom-left corner of plate. All dims in mm.
=============================================================
CONFIGURATION
  C-Beam extrusion  : 40 x 80 mm (V-slot face = 80mm front)
  V-wheels          : 6x Solid V-Wheel on C-beam front 80mm face
  MGN9H linear rails: 2 rails mounted on LEFT and RIGHT side
                      faces of C-beam (40mm faces)
  MGN9H carriages   : 4 total (2 per rail), bolted to plate back
  Lead screw        : TR8x8 Acme, nut centred at (62.5, 62.5)
  Router mounts     : 2x Makita RT0702/700C 65mm clamp adapter
=============================================================
LAYER LEGEND
  OUTLINE          (white)  Plate cut boundary 125 x 125 mm
  VWHEEL_FIXED     (cyan)   Dia 5.0 mm  x3  Fixed V-wheel M5 holes
  VWHEEL_ECCENTRIC (green)  Dia 7.8 mm  x3  Eccentric spacer V-wheel holes
  M3_HOLES         (red)    Dia 3.2 mm  x16 MGN9H carriage M3 bolts
  M4_HOLES         (yellow) Dia 4.3 mm  x4  TR8x8 nut block M4 bolts
  M5_HOLES         (blue)   Dia 5.3 mm  x8  Makita adapter M5 bolts
  LEADSCREW        (magenta) Dia 9.0 mm  x1  Lead-screw shaft clearance
  MGRID            (grey)   Dia 5.0 mm  x20 M5 20mm utility grid holes
=============================================================
HOLE COORDINATE TABLE
--- V-WHEEL FIXED holes (Dia 5.0 mm) ---
  Top-left    : (20.0, 105.0)
  Top-right   : (105.0, 105.0)
  Bottom-left : (20.0,  20.0)
--- V-WHEEL ECCENTRIC holes (Dia 7.8 mm) ---
  Top-centre  : (62.5, 115.0)
  Bottom-ctr  : (62.5,  10.0)
  Mid-right   : (115.0, 62.5)
--- MGN9H M3 HOLES (Dia 3.2 mm) ---
  Rails mount on LEFT (X=-) and RIGHT (X=+) C-beam side faces.
  Carriages bolt to BACK face of this plate.
  Rail 1 (left side of C-beam) - carriage X-centre on plate = 25 mm
    Carriage A top    (Y-ctr=95): (21,85)(29,85)(21,105)(29,105)
    Carriage B bottom (Y-ctr=30): (21,20)(29,20)(21,40)(29,40)
  Rail 2 (right side of C-beam) - carriage X-centre on plate = 100 mm
    Carriage A top    (Y-ctr=95): (96,85)(104,85)(96,105)(104,105)
    Carriage B bottom (Y-ctr=30): (96,20)(104,20)(96,40)(104,40)
  Rail spacing H  : 75 mm c-c
  Carriage spacing V : 65 mm c-c
--- TR8x8 NUT BLOCK M4 HOLES (Dia 4.3 mm) ---
  20 mm square pattern centred at plate centre (62.5, 62.5)
  (52.5,52.5)(72.5,52.5)(52.5,72.5)(72.5,72.5)
--- Makita ADAPTER M5 HOLES (Dia 5.3 mm) ---
  Adapter 1 (upper, Y-ctr=95): (32.5,80)(92.5,80)(32.5,110)(92.5,110)
  Adapter 2 (lower, Y-ctr=30): (32.5,15)(92.5,15)(32.5,45)(92.5,45)
--- LEAD SCREW CLEARANCE (Dia 9.0 mm) ---
  Centre: (62.5, 62.5)
--- M5 UTILITY GRID (Dia 5.0 mm) 20mm spacing ---
  Row Y=20:  (40,20)(60,20)(80,20)
  Row Y=40:  (40,40)(60,40)(80,40)
  Row Y=60:  (40,60)(80,60)   [centre omitted - leadscrew]
  Row Y=80:  (40,80)(60,80)(80,80)
  Row Y=100: (40,100)(60,100)(80,100)
=============================================================

